### 手搓请求用（VS Code 装 "REST Client" 扩展后，点 Send Request）
### 或 JetBrains 系列的内置 HTTP Client 也能直接用这个文件。
### 前提：另一个窗口里跑着 `py -3.14 -u scripts/mock_analyze_server.py`

@host = http://127.0.0.1:5001

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### 分析：米饭
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="rice.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./tests/fixtures/rice.jpeg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="meal_type"

lunch
--WebAppBoundary--

### 分析：红烧肉（应命中 pork_belly_braised）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="red-braised-pork.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./tests/fixtures/red-braised-pork.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="meal_type"

dinner
--WebAppBoundary--

### 错误路径：缺 meal_type → 400 INVALID_REQUEST
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="rice.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./tests/fixtures/rice.jpeg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 错误路径：非图片 → 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="README.md"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./README.md
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="meal_type"

lunch
--WebAppBoundary--

### 负样本：灰图 → 200 + data.status="error"
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="placeholder.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./tests/fixtures/placeholder.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="meal_type"

snack
--WebAppBoundary--

